<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Login</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Darker+Grotesque:wght@400;600&display=swap');

    * {
      font-family: 'Darker Grotesque', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      overflow-x: hidden;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #B82121;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .first-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;

    }

    .first-main .photo-main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      margin-right: 0;
    }

    .first-main .login-main {
      margin-right: 20rem;
      margin-left: 10rem;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .first-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo-login-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-left: 2rem;
    }

    button {
      margin-left: 2rem;

    }

    .second-main {
      margin-top: 10rem;
      margin-bottom: 10rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;

      justify-content: center;
      background-color: #B82121;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .second-main p {
      margin-top: 3%;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 5px;
      border-color: #0B364C;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 43px;
    }

    .footer {
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      background: #0B364C;
      color: #fff;
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 -2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      padding: 0;
      height: 64px;
    }

    .footer .socials {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .footer .socials img {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
      transition: filter 0.2s;
    }

    .footer .socials img:hover {
      filter: brightness(0.8) invert(0.7) sepia(1) saturate(5) hue-rotate(180deg);
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: 'Darker Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .login-box-login-main {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 40px 36px 32px 36px;
      min-width: 320px;
      max-width: 350px;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .login-box {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction:
        column;

      gap: 6px;
    }

    .login-box p {
      display: block;
      text-align: left;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 2px 2px;

    }

    .login-box input[type="text"],
    .login-box input[type="password"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid #0B364C;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      background: #F5F6FA;
      color: #ffffff;
      outline: none;
      transition: border 0.2s;
    }

    .login-box input[type="text"]:focus,
    .login-box input[type="password"]:focus {
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .login-button {
      width: 100%;
      background: #0B364C;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 0;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(11, 54, 76, 0.08);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .login-button:hover {
      background: #08263a;
    }

    .login-box-login-main label {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .login-box-login-main input[type="checkbox"] {
      color: #fff;
      accent-color: #0B364C;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .logo-login-main {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .logo-login-main img {
      width: 321px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .logo-login-main p {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .login-main {
      margin-top: 10rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="first-main">

    <div class="photo-main">
      <img src="/assets/PNG_images/image 20.png" alt="" srcset="">
    </div>

    <div class="login-main">
      <div class="logo-login-main">
        <img src="/assets/PNG_images/Frame 6.png" alt="Diana-platform-logo">
        <p>Access - St. Paul’s Parent’s Portal</p>
      </div>

      <div class="login-box-login-main">
        <div class="login-box">
          <p>E-mail</p>
          <input type="text" id="email" placeholder="E-mail" />
        </div>
        <div class="login-box">
          <p>Password</p>
          <input type="password" id="password" placeholder="Password" />
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <input type="checkbox" id="stay-connected" name="stay-connected" />
          <label for="stay-connected">Stay connected?</label>
        </div>
        <button class="login-button" id="login-button">Login</button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="second-main">
    <img src="/assets/PNG_images/BRAND_ST PAULS_White Outline (2) 1.png">
    <p>We are the British school of São Paulo. At St. Paul’s we always strive to be the best we can be. We have the
      courage of our convictions, essential <br> values, and the freedom to imagine and create. This is achieved through
      our
      high-quality British and Brazilian holistic education which <br> drives the personal and academic development of
      pupils, within a caring, inclusive and united community.  </p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="socials">
      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.stpauls.br/"><img src="/assets/PNG_images/St._Paul's_School_new_logo_2016 1.png"
          alt="st-pauls-loog"></a>

      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.instagram.com/stpaulsschoolsp/?hl=pt"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/Instagram Old.png" alt="instagram"></a>

      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/StPaulsschoolSP/?locale=pt_BR"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/Facebook.png" alt="facebook"></a>

      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/stpaulsschool/people/?originalSubdomain=br"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/linkedin.png" alt="linkedin"></a>
    </div>

    <p>Copyright © 2025 Saint Pauls. All rights reserved. Privacy Policy. All rights reserved by Saint Paul.</p>
  </div>


  <script>
    document.getElementById('login-button').addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value;
      const name = document.getElementById('password').value;

      try {
        const response = await fetch('http://localhost:3000/users', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ name, email })
        });

        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Erro ao criar usuário');

        const data = await response.json();
        alert(`Usuário criado com sucesso! ID: ${data.id}`);
        window.location.href = '/choose';
      } catch (err) {
        alert(`Erro: ${err.message}`);
      }
    });
  </script>

</body>

</html>